<c>are </c><00:00:02.007><c>incomplete </c><00:00:02.008><c>about </c><00:00:02.009><c>it  </c><00:00:02.010><c>but </c><00:00:02.011><c>those </c><00:00:02.012><c>matters </c><00:00:02.013><c>require </c><00:00:02.014><c>a </c><00:00:02.015><c>deeper </c><00:00:02.016><c>dive  </c><00:00:02.017><c>into </c><00:00:02.018><c>both </c><00:00:02.019><c>relativity </c><00:00:02.020><c>and </c><00:00:02.021><c>topology  </c><00:00:02.022><c>so </c><00:00:02.023><c>stay </c><00:00:02.024><c>tuned </c><00:00:02.025><c>as </c><00:00:02.026><c>we'll </c><00:00:02.027><c>continue  </c><00:00:02.028><c>exploring </c><00:00:02.029><c>the </c><00:00:02.030><c>meaning </c><00:00:02.031><c>of </c><00:00:02.032><c>space-time  </c><00:00:02.033><c>curvature </c><00:00:02.034><c>in </c><00:00:02.035><c>future </c><00:00:02.036><c>videos  </c><00:00:02.037><c>this </c><00:00:02.038><c>has </c><00:00:02.039><c>been </c><00:00:02.040><c>dialect </c><00:00:02.041><c>thanks </c><00:00:02.042><c>for  </c><00:00:02.043><c>watching</c>

